+# M859: NetworkProtocolDecoder
+
+Decodes LoL network protocols via Fiddler proxy integration with Proxifier
+
+## Dependencies
+
+M846
+
+## Interfaces
+
+- `configure_fiddler(host: str, port: int, api_key: str) -> bool`
